{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_47704","headline":"遗简诗 一 · 赵惠宗","name":"遗简诗 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"生我於虚，置我於无。\n至精爲神，元气爲躯。\n散阳爲明，合阴爲符。\n形爲灰土，神爲仙居。\n衆垢将毕，万事永除。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"赵惠宗","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_47704.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_47704","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"杂言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}